{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"uv.lock","reason":"Relock so click resolves to 8.4.2 (>= the PYSEC-2026-2132 fix version 8.3.3) instead of the vulnerable 8.2.1; records the uv override in the lock manifest. Only click changes, plus one stale zipfile-zstd marker any relock corrects."},{"path":"pyproject.toml","reason":"Add [tool.uv] override-dependencies = [\"click>=8.3.3\"] with the rationale and a REMOVE-WHEN. Required because inspect-ai caps click<8.2.2, which pins the universal resolution to the vulnerable 8.2.1 and makes a lock-only bump impossible."}]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1785712169038753001,"uuid":"04d789e1-3f49-48aa-80a7-fa1dfd4483ab"}